<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <script>
        (function () {
            var bridgeNames = ['ToutiaoJSBridge', 'BDXBridge'];
            bridgeNames.forEach(function (bridgeName) {
                delete window[bridgeName];
                Object.defineProperty(window, bridgeName, {
                    configurable: false,
                    enumerable: false,
                    get: function get() { return undefined; },
                    set: function set(_) {},
                });
            });
        })();
    </script>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>完美煮蛋定時器 - 究極版</title>
    <script src="https://marscode-static.doubaocdn.com/_lib/app-main.js"></script>
    <link href="https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/resource/npm/@fontsource/nunito@latest/index.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/resource/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@3.4.17/dist/index.global.js"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: { bg: '#FDFBF7', yolk: '#FFB300', text: '#4A4A4A', shadow: '#D1CFC7' },
                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Nunito', 'sans-serif'] },
                },
            },
        };
    </script>
    <script src="https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/resource/npm/lucide@0.560.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #e5e5e5; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif; overflow: hidden; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
        #app-shell { background-color: #fdfbf7; width: 100%; height: 100vh; height: 100dvh; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        @media (min-width: 1025px) { body { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; } #app-shell { width: 480px; height: 640px; border-radius: 30px; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); border: 8px solid #fdfbf7; } }
        .hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .hide-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }
        .neu-flat { background: #fdfbf7; box-shadow: 6px 6px 12px #d1cfc7, -6px -6px 12px #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; }
        .neu-pressed { background: #fdfbf7; box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 8px #d1cfc7, inset -4px -4px 8px #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; }
        .neu-btn:active:not(:disabled) { box-shadow: inset 3px 3px 6px #d1cfc7, inset -3px -3px 6px #ffffff; transform: scale(0.95); }
        .neu-primary { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffc107, #ffb300); box-shadow: 6px 6px 12px #d99800, -6px -6px 12px #ffeeb3; color: white; }
        .progress-ring__circle { transform: rotate(-90deg); transform-origin: 50% 50%; }
        @keyframes bg-flash { 0%, 100% { background-color: #fdfbf7; } 50% { background-color: #ffe0b2; } }
        .alarm-state { animation: bg-flash 1s infinite; }
        @keyframes bg-flash-blue { 0%, 100% { background-color: #fdfbf7; } 50% { background-color: #bfdbfe; } }
        .alarm-state-blue { animation: bg-flash-blue 1s infinite; }
        .egg-figure-preview { width: 44px; height: 58px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 26px; border: 2px solid transparent; transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); }
        .selected-egg { border-color: #ffb300; transform: scale(1.15); box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.3); background: white; }
        #doneness-container { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; min-width: 100%; }
        .real-egg-shape { border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 50% / 60% 60% 40% 40%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff9f0 0%, #f7e8d0 100%); position: relative; box-shadow: inset -4px -6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 2px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); transition: all 0.3s ease; }
        .recipe-card { transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); }
        .recipe-card:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
        button { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; touch-action: manipulation; outline: none; }
        .pointer-events-none { pointer-events: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="app-shell">
        <header class="pt-6 px-6 flex-none flex justify-between items-center z-20">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-black tracking-wider text-gray-600">完美鷄蛋</h1>
            <button onclick="openRecipeCollection()" class="neu-flat px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500 active:text-yolk transition-colors">
                <i data-lucide="book-open" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider">更多蛋料理</span>
            </button>
        </header>

        <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto hide-scrollbar px-6 pt-4 pb-4 relative w-full">
            <div id="settings-panel" class="space-y-6 transition-all duration-500">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div class="neu-flat p-3 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-pointer neu-btn h-24" onclick="toggleTemp()">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">初始溫度</span>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-yolk font-bold mt-1">
                            <i id="icon-temp" data-lucide="snowflake" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                            <span id="text-temp" class="text-lg">冷藏</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="neu-flat p-3 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-pointer neu-btn h-24" onclick="toggleSizeDetail()">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">雞蛋規格</span>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-yolk font-bold mt-1">
                            <span id="text-size-main" class="text-2xl uppercase">M</span>
                            <span id="text-size-sub" class="text-sm text-gray-400">(53-63g)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="neu-flat p-4">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">爐灶瓦數</span>
                        <span id="wattage-display" class="text-xs font-bold text-yolk bg-yolk/10 px-2 py-1 rounded">2000W</span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="range" min="1000" max="3000" step="100" value="2000" class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-yolk" oninput="updateWattage(this.value)">
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-1">目標熟度</span>
                    <div class="neu-pressed py-6 px-2 overflow-x-auto hide-scrollbar">
                        <div id="doneness-container"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center h-14 flex flex-col justify-center">
                        <h2 id="doneness-big-title" class="text-2xl font-black text-yolk">溏心 (Jammy)</h2>
                        <p id="doneness-sub-desc" class="text-xs text-gray-400">蛋黃呈膏狀，中心微流</p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="tips-panel" class="px-1 mt-4"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 relative w-full">
                <button id="btn-minus" disabled class="neu-flat w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed transition-all duration-300 shrink-0 neu-btn">
                    <i data-lucide="minus" class="w-6 h-6 pointer-events-none"></i>
                </button>
                
                <div class="relative w-64 h-64 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                    <svg id="timer-svg" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full drop-shadow-2xl" viewBox="0 0 140 140">
                        <circle class="text-gray-200" stroke-width="6" stroke="currentColor" fill="transparent" r="64" cx="70" cy="70" />
                        <circle id="progress-ring" class="progress-ring__circle text-yolk" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke="currentColor" fill="transparent" r="64" cx="70" cy="70" style="color: #FFB300;" />
                        <circle id="overtime-ring" class="progress-ring__circle opacity-0" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke="currentColor" fill="transparent" r="64" cx="70" cy="70" style="color: #60A5FA;" />
                    </svg>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-center z-10 text-center">
                        <div id="timer-display" class="text-6xl font-black text-gray-700 tracking-tighter tabular-nums transition-colors duration-300">06:30</div>
                        <div id="timer-status" class="text-xs font-bold text-yolk mt-3 bg-white/80 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm transition-all duration-300">水開後放入</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button id="btn-plus" disabled class="neu-flat w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed transition-all duration-300 shrink-0 neu-btn">
                    <i data-lucide="plus" class="w-6 h-6 pointer-events-none"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </main>

        <div id="size-modal-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-[2px] z-40 hidden transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0" onclick="toggleSizeDetail()"></div>
        <div id="size-modal" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-white rounded-t-[40px] z-50 p-8 shadow-2xl modal-closed transition-transform duration-300 transform translate-y-full">
            <h3 class="text-center font-black text-gray-600 mb-8 tracking-widest uppercase text-sm">選擇雞蛋規格</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
                <div onclick="selectSize('s')" class="size-option flex flex-col items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-3xl transition-all cursor-pointer"><div class="real-egg-shape border border-orange-100" style="width: 3.4rem; height: 4.4rem"></div><span class="font-black text-xl">S</span></div>
                <div onclick="selectSize('m')" class="size-option flex flex-col items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-3xl transition-all cursor-pointer neu-pressed"><div class="real-egg-shape border border-orange-100" style="width: 3.9rem; height: 5.1rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB300 0%, #FF8F00 100%);"></div><span class="font-black text-xl">M</span></div>
                <div onclick="selectSize('l')" class="size-option flex flex-col items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-3xl transition-all cursor-pointer"><div class="real-egg-shape border border-orange-100" style="width: 4.4rem; height: 5.8rem"></div><span class="font-black text-xl">L</span></div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="toggleSizeDetail()" class="neu-primary w-full h-14 rounded-2xl font-bold tracking-widest active:scale-95 transition-transform">確認</button>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-none px-8 py-6 bg-bg z-30 shrink-0">
            <button id="main-btn" onclick="toggleTimer()" class="neu-primary w-full h-16 rounded-2xl text-xl font-bold tracking-widest flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-xl transition-all active:scale-95">
                <i id="main-btn-icon" data-lucide="play" fill="currentColor"></i><span id="main-btn-text">開始煮</span>
            </button>
        </div>

        <div id="recipe-collection" class="absolute inset-0 z-[55] bg-bg hidden flex-col overflow-hidden">
            <div class="pt-6 px-6 pb-4 flex items-center justify-between bg-bg/90 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-10">
                <button onclick="closeRecipeCollection()" class="neu-flat w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-6 h-6"></i></button>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-700">蛋料理靈感</h2>
                <button onclick="openHelpModal()" class="neu-flat w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 transition-transform active:scale-95">
                    <i data-lucide="help-circle" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6 space-y-6 pb-20">
                <div class="neu-flat p-3 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <i data-lucide="search" class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-400"></i>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="搜尋食譜..." class="bg-transparent flex-1 outline-none text-sm text-gray-600" onclick="playClickSound()" oninput="searchRecipes(this.value)">
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-3 overflow-x-auto hide-scrollbar pb-2">
                    <button onclick="filterRecipes('all')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-yolk text-white rounded-full text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap shadow-md">全部</button>
                    <button onclick="filterRecipes('chinese')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-white text-gray-600 rounded-full text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm border">中式</button>
                    <button onclick="filterRecipes('western')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-white text-gray-600 rounded-full text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm border">西式</button>
                    <button onclick="filterRecipes('japanese')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-white text-gray-600 rounded-full text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm border">日式</button>
                    <button onclick="filterRecipes('korean')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-white text-gray-600 rounded-full text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm border">韓式</button>
                </div>
                <div id="recipe-list" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="recipe-detail-modal" class="absolute inset-0 z-[60] bg-black/50 hidden items-end justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0">
            <div class="bg-white w-full rounded-t-3xl h-[90vh] flex flex-col transform translate-y-full transition-transform duration-300" id="recipe-detail-content">
                <div class="relative h-48 shrink-0">
                    <img id="detail-image" src="" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-t-3xl">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent rounded-t-3xl"></div>
                    <button onclick="closeRecipeDetail()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-10 h-10 bg-black/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white"><i data-lucide="x"></i></button>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-6 text-white">
                        <span id="detail-tag" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-yolk text-black text-[10px] font-bold rounded mb-2 inline-block"></span>
                        <h2 id="detail-title" class="text-2xl font-black"></h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6 space-y-6">
                    <p id="detail-desc" class="text-gray-600 text-sm"></p>
                    <div class="neu-flat p-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-gray-50 cursor-pointer" onclick="playRecipeVideo()">
                        <div class="w-full aspect-video bg-black/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden group">
                            <img id="detail-video-thumb" src="" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
                                <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-transform group-active:scale-90"><i data-lucide="play" class="w-6 h-6 text-yolk ml-1"></i></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold">點擊觀看演示影片</p>
                    </div>
                    <div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="shopping-basket" class="w-4 h-4 text-yolk"></i> 食材準備</h3><ul id="detail-ingredients" class="text-sm text-gray-600 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"></ul></div>
                    <div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="list-ordered" class="w-4 h-4 text-yolk"></i> 烹飪步驟</h3><div id="detail-steps" class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-4"></div></div>
                    
                    <div class="neu-flat p-4 border-t-4 border-t-yolk mt-6 mb-8">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-yolk rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white"><i data-lucide="bot" class="w-5 h-5"></i></div>
                                <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800">智慧廚藝助手</h3>
                            </div>
                            <button onclick="toggleAIMode()" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                                <span id="mode-icon" class="text-sm">👨‍🍳</span>
                                <span id="mode-text">大廚模式</span>
                                <i data-lucide="refresh-cw" class="w-3 h-3 ml-0.5 text-gray-400"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <div id="ai-chat-history" class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-4 max-h-40 overflow-y-auto space-y-2 leading-relaxed bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
                            <div><b>AI：</b>我是你的蛋料理專家！有任何問題都可以問我喔！</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-3 overflow-x-auto hide-scrollbar">
                            <button onclick="sendQuickMsg('講個笑話來聽聽！')" class="shrink-0 px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-sm">😂 講個笑話</button>
                            <button onclick="sendQuickMsg('這道菜有什麼不敗秘訣？')" class="shrink-0 px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-sm">🤫 不敗秘訣</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-2">
                            <input type="text" id="ai-input" placeholder="輸入問題..." class="flex-1 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm outline-none focus:border-yolk" onclick="playClickSound()" onkeypress="if(event.key === 'Enter') askAI()">
                            <button onclick="askAI()" class="bg-yolk text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm shadow-md">發送</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="video-player-container" class="absolute inset-0 z-[80] bg-black/95 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm">
            <button onclick="closeVideoPlayer()" class="absolute top-8 right-6 text-white w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center z-50 bg-white/20 rounded-full hover:bg-white/30 transition"><i data-lucide="x" class="w-6 h-6"></i></button>
            <div id="video-content-area" class="w-full aspect-video px-4 sm:px-8 max-w-3xl"></div>
            <p id="video-player-title" class="text-white text-lg font-bold mt-6 tracking-widest"></p>
        </div>

        <div id="fake-video-player" class="absolute inset-0 z-[80] bg-gray-900 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <button onclick="closeFakeVideoPlayer()" class="absolute top-8 right-6 text-white w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center z-50 bg-white/20 rounded-full"><i data-lucide="x" class="w-6 h-6"></i></button>
            <div class="w-full aspect-video px-8">
                <div class="w-full h-full bg-black rounded-xl relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
                    <img id="fake-video-thumb" src="" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40">
                    <div class="z-10 text-center text-white p-6">
                        <i data-lucide="chef-hat" class="w-12 h-12 text-yolk mx-auto mb-4 animate-pulse"></i>
                        <h3 id="fake-video-title" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4"></h3>
                        <p id="fake-video-step" class="text-lg text-yolk font-bold"></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="finish-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 z-50 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center bg-yolk/95 text-white p-8 transition-colors duration-500">
            <h2 id="finish-title" class="text-5xl font-black mb-2 tracking-wider">時間到！</h2>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mt-10 w-full max-w-[240px]">
                <button id="btn-ice-water" onclick="startIceWater()" class="bg-blue-50 text-blue-500 px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl font-black shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2 active:scale-95 transition-transform"><span class="text-2xl">❄️</span> 冰鎮3分鐘</button>
                <button id="btn-done" onclick="resetApp()" class="bg-white text-yolk px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl font-black shadow-xl active:scale-95 transition-transform">完美搞定</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="help-modal" class="absolute inset-0 z-[70] bg-black/50 hidden items-center justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0 px-6">
            <div class="bg-white w-full max-h-[80vh] rounded-3xl p-6 flex flex-col transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-2xl" id="help-modal-content">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3">
                    <h3 class="font-black text-xl text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="info" class="w-6 h-6 text-yolk"></i> 使用說明
                    </h3>
                    <button onclick="closeHelpModal()" class="w-8 h-8 bg-gray-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 active:scale-90 transition-transform">
                        <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto hide-scrollbar text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-yolk/10 rounded-xl border border-yolk/30 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                        <p><b>🥚 關於食譜：</b><br>這裡收錄了多種精選蛋料理，點擊卡片即可查看詳細步驟與教學影片。</p>
                        <p><b>🍳 影片播放注意事項：</b><br>部分影片使用 YouTube 來源，若無法播放，請您手動跳轉到youtube</p>
                        <p><b>🤖 智慧廚藝助手(AI語氣版)：</b><br>在食譜詳情頁的底部，你可以詢問 AI 關於這道菜的烹飪技巧。點擊右上角的「大廚/阿嫲模式」按鈕，可以自由切換不同風格的助手！還有快捷按鈕可以快速互動喔！</p>
                        <p><b>❄️ 冰水冷卻模式：</b><br>煮蛋時間結束後，點擊「冰鎮3分鐘」按鈕，讓半熟蛋更好剝殼！如果在冰鎮中按下停止，會直接取消冷卻步驟。</p>
                        <p><b>❄️🌀 俄羅斯套娃破表模式：</b><br>無聊的話可以瘋狂按「+」號！突破預設時間後，進度條會出現酷炫的多層冷藍色疊加效果！看看你能疊出幾種藍色！</p>
                    </div>
                    <p><b>🙏 感謝：</b><br>各大youtube教程影片提供者, 馬田, 豆包AI, Gemini, deepseek, cookpad......</p>
                </div>
